WEBVTT

00:49:59.929 --> 00:50:03.966
and then decide that it's too hard
and not show up for it.

00:50:03.990 --> 00:50:06.741
That's really what it's about for me.

00:50:07.674 --> 00:50:09.551
It's an honor to be in grief.

00:50:11.793 --> 00:50:15.296
It's an honor to feel that much,

00:50:15.320 --> 00:50:16.741
to have loved that much,

00:50:16.765 --> 00:50:18.833
and it's what's owed.

00:50:18.857 --> 00:50:21.635
It has a lot of anger in it, too,
which I find interesting.

00:50:21.659 --> 00:50:25.117
In February and March,
I was just sick with rage,

00:50:25.141 --> 00:50:29.638
and I had this thought for a while
that I was frustrated

00:50:29.662 --> 00:50:32.242
because I felt like this
is interfering with my grief,